187	/* ── the slide deck ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
188	   Height animates to the ACTIVE slide so the page does not size itself to the
189	   tallest one. Inactive slides are `inert`: without it a keyboard user tabs
190	   straight into the controls of a step that is scrolled off-screen. */
